# Generated deployment artifacts (binaries, transfer chunks, staging keys).
# NEVER commit: dist/keys/* contains private key material (host-to-host
# staging key). Rebuild via `go build`; regenerate keys per L5 runbook.
dist/

# D3b: reproducible Linux amd64 build artifacts (scripts/build-linux.sh output).
# NEVER commit: only the SHA256SUMS sidecar may be copied to a release manifest.
dist_onclick/

# T3 Pinned-Xray gate: rendered fixed-vector config written at CI run time
# (contains the documented non-production test vector; regenerate, never commit).
internal/xray/testdata/e2e/

# T4 Pinned-Caddy gate: rendered fixed-vector Caddyfiles written at CI run
# time (contains the documented non-production test vectors; regenerate,
# never commit).
internal/origin/testdata/e2e/

# Phase 2 subtask 4: one-time operational scratch files (plain-HTTP migration)
# and preserved stray root files. NOT part of the module; recoverable only.
ops-scratch/
archive/

# SSH key material (subtask 9 key hygiene). Private keys live under ssh/ and
# must NEVER be committed; the directory is not tracked and is ignored here so
# a future `git add .` can never stage private key material.
ssh/

# Defensive backstop: ignore common private-key filename patterns anywhere in
# the tree, even if they appear outside ssh/.
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# ---- Commit hygiene (subtask 22): keep generated/scratch/secret dirs out of any
# `git add .`. These are NOT part of the Go module.
#
# Generated build staging (cross-compiled release binaries, e2e scratch).
staging-upread-build/
out/

# Manifests captured at deploy time (host manifests, probe scripts, capture
# helpers). Operational scratch, not source of record.
manifests/

# Ad-hoc API/vendor reference dumps (CDN yml, notes). Not module source.
arvan api documents/

# One-off root scratch/log files and archives from the flow-control work.
.git-baseline-phaseb.txt
build_phaseb.txt
offbuild.txt
offresult.txt
p6all.sh
race678-src.tar.gz
rollback-iran-splitter.sh
.roomodes

# FINAL-SUITE: test-run evidence + the LOCAL SOCKS5 credentials file
# (secret). NEVER commit this directory.
final-suite/

# Local backup folder (pre-deploy snapshots, unit/binary copies). Never commit.
backups/
